{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT IS BROKEN_SYSTEM?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broken_System is a puzzle-adventure game set in a dystopian future where everything and everyone is controlled by a massive corporation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992380/extras/bbd71ba89fde051964f8ae88f9f41b60.avif?t=1757694921\" data-has-big width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHO ARE YOU?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game you will impersonate an employee working for this company--until one day, you receive a message from a rebel group asking for your help. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992380/extras/e53befb48018e28b38f785a227343b7f.avif?t=1757694921\" data-has-big width=1560 height=627 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR MISSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to fix this broken system?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3992380?t=1757694921","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992380/1459cf10fc72fe4b6d7770dabfe6f413844ba93f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757694921","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992380/aeb1a348061ab2bf56f23c8dd358d5f5d579c9a2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757694921","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992380/aeb1a348061ab2bf56f23c8dd358d5f5d579c9a2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757694921","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT IS BROKEN_SYSTEM?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broken_System is a puzzle-adventure game set in a dystopian future where everything and everyone is controlled by a massive corporation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992380/extras/bbd71ba89fde051964f8ae88f9f41b60.avif?t=1757694921\" data-has-big width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHO ARE YOU?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game you will impersonate an employee working for this company--until one day, you receive a message from a rebel group asking for your help. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992380/extras/e53befb48018e28b38f785a227343b7f.avif?t=1757694921\" data-has-big width=1560 height=627 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR MISSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to fix this broken system?</p>","developers":["Lamp","Strausste"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992380/33dae64bc60228645df9761cf7c5e563552dc5d2/header.jpg?t=1757694921","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 5500u<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated GPU<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Low settings, 720p</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3992380/623276219/2cad0017d267b84a505e82a3d21f4a3b509d0279/1757242926/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757694919","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3992380/623276219/2cad0017d267b84a505e82a3d21f4a3b509d0279/1757242926/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757694919","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steam